ADDITIONAL WARNING (not part of the MIT license terms, but stated plainly):

This software relocates installed applications and their data folders on disk.
Although it uses directory junctions to preserve compatibility, verifies every
copy before deleting anything, and provides an undo function, ANY DISK
RELOCATION CARRIES RISK. This includes — but is not limited to — target disk
failure, applications that rewrite their own directory, anti-cheat or DRM
software that validates its own path, and changes made by other tools while a
relocation is in progress.

Always make sure you have a backup of important data before using it.
